     <actual value="10">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Five National societies were hosted in the period including Ethiopian Red Cross, Somali Red crescent, Mali Red cross, Sudan Red Crescent and Chinese Red cross Foundation.
The delegations were interested in learning about the 2011 drought relief funds donation campaign by KRCS with private sector&#x201D; Kenyans for Kenya&#x201D; that raised over a billion Kshs in aid and the ongoing similar &#x201C;Lisha mtoto initiative&#x201D;. They also sought to learn on the Kenyan experience on Resource mobilization strategies, Partnerships management, supply chain, Youth, organizational development structures and strategies, Cost recovery and programing strategies.
Solferino academy seconded senior N. S leadership for a learning visit to KRCS from 5 national societies (China, Russia, Lesotho, Iran and Costa Rica). The area of learning interests included the transformational journey on governance, financial sustainability, organizational structure, systems and culture.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
